WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.520
Bluey!

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:10.640
Oh, what a splendid moustache you have!

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:13.960
Ooh! Lovely.

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:17.640
It's my turn to unfreeze him.

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:19.480
Unfreeze!
(DING!)

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:21.560
Oh, what?!
(THEY GIGGLE)

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:23.120
Arghh! You kids!

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:24.680
- Run!
- Grr!

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:28.000
Give me that magic xylophone!

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.320
Gotcha!
(BLUEY SQUEALS)

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:30.320
(DING!)

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:32.880
Ha-ha! Too slow, Mr Moustache!

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:36.160
Bluey, you're taking all the turns freezing.

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:38.840
Come on, Bingo! Let's get the teddies.

00:00:38.840 --> 00:00:40.480
OK.

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:52.080
(THEY GIGGLE)

00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:56.000
- I'm off to work. 
- Mum! Mum! Look at Dad now!

00:00:56.720 --> 00:01:00.600
This loose hair has been 
bugging me all morning!

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:04.440
OK, I'll unfreeze him.

00:01:04.440 --> 00:01:05.840
I want to do it.

00:01:05.840 --> 00:01:09.120
Mum, Bluey's not letting me have any turns.

00:01:09.120 --> 00:01:11.600
Bluey, if you don't take turns with people,

00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:13.520
people won't take turns with you.

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:15.400
But Bingo is too slow. 

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:16.640
Dad will catch her.

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:18.480
No, I'm not.

00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:20.160
You can either take turns 

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:22.360
or I'll bring the xylophone to work with me.

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:23.840
I'll freeze my boss. 

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:26.120
- [Both] No! 
- Nnn! Nnnnn!

00:01:26.120 --> 00:01:28.160
Well, you know what to do then.

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:29.160
I'll see you later.

00:01:29.160 --> 00:01:32.160
Just make sure you unfreeze 
him for toilet breaks, OK?

00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:33.240
[Both] OK!

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:37.560
Here, Bingo. But stand right back here.

00:01:37.560 --> 00:01:39.440
That way you can get a headstart.

00:01:39.440 --> 00:01:42.240
He runs really fast when he's mad.

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:43.960
OK! Unfreeze!

00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:44.760
(DING!)

00:01:44.760 --> 00:01:46.080
(THEY GIGGLE)

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:48.840
- There you are! Grrr! 
- Run, Bingo!

00:01:48.840 --> 00:01:50.840
Back inside!
- Grrrr!

